WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
[Playful orchestral music]

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.500
[The llama grunts]

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
[The chick squeaks]

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.000
[A steam whistle blows]

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.000
[The music builds]

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:58.500
[Wood cracks and breaks]

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
[Rumbling and crashing]

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.500
[Crashes]

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.500
[Thuds]

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:47.000
[The chick calls]

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.000
[Penguins chatter]

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:14.000
[Gentle music]

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:29.000
[Music]

